   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This mesh gradient background features a serene mix of blue, black, and white with rounded, flowing shapes. The design is textured with a slight noise, giving it a smooth yet organic feel.</rdf:li>
